8. Challenges & Learnings

Integrating chatbot functionality for emergency suggestions.

Managing frontend-backend communication using TypeScript and shared types.

Implementing a secure and scalable database structure using Drizzle ORM.

Styling the interface with TailwindCSS for responsive design.

9. Future Improvements

Add real-time chat support with doctors.

Integrate payment gateway for medicine orders.

Implement location-based hospital recommendations.

Enhance AI chatbot for more accurate symptom detection.
